  "dateUploaded": "2026-11-08T19:42:10.472Z",
  "plot": "In an alternate version of Oakland, Cassius Green gets a telemarketing job and finds the commission paid job a dispiriting struggle as a Black man selling to predominantly white people over the phone. This changes when a veteran advises him to use his \"white voic2\" and the attitude behind it to make himself more appealing to customers. With a bizarrely high-pitched accent, Cassius becomes a success even as his colleagues form a union to improve their miserable jobs. Cassius is promoted to being a \"Power Caller\" who sells the most morally-abhorrent but lucrative products and services--as his connection to his girlfriend and colleagues fades away. His conscience arises anew amid his boss' bizarre world of condescending, bigoted decadence and his sinister plans to create the perfect subservient workforce with Cassius' help.",
